# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 上出现大量 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 提示，
# 也避免不同系统之间产生整文件的假 diff。
#
#   text=auto  → 仓库内统一存 LF，检出时按平台自动转换
#   *.bat      → 强制 CRLF：cmd.exe 在 LF-only 的批处理文件上会解析错位
#   *.png 等   → 标记为二进制，禁止任何换行转换

* text=auto

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.py   text
*.js   text
*.css  text
*.html text
*.md   text
*.txt  text
*.json text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.pyd  binary
